[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3448565682","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112041#issuecomment-3448565682","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112041","id":3448565682,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7NjO-y","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-26T13:54:39Z","updated_at":"2025-10-26T13:54:55Z","body":"I'd be interested to see a compile time comparison before and after this PR.\r\nOn my computer, the file takes a good 10-20 seconds to compile, which often ends up being a critical path for me during compilation. But generally, this 'SCU build' strategy is faster overall, and if we turn this single 10 second thread-time into 50 times 1 second thread times, that should still be an overall loss of performance.\r\n\r\nA middle ground could be acceptable, where e.g. we split the one test file into ~10 compile units. This may still leave us with slightly worse overall thread time, but should solve the 'critical path' problem.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3448565682/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3448806676","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112041#issuecomment-3448806676","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112041","id":3448806676,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7NkJ0U","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-26T19:01:46Z","updated_at":"2025-10-26T19:01:46Z","body":"@Ivorforce Better yet, I've just made sure this accounts for SCU builds as well. It *does* make sense to replicate the old behavior when already expecting a single compilation unit. It's a bit hacky, as SCU registration/identification is pretty hardcoded atm, but it gets the job done\r\n\r\nFor standard builds, it'd only be a loss for initial compilations, otherwise the only tests that'd be recompiled are those that had differences in their headers. I was going to trim down the headers in stuff like `test_macros.h` at a later point to keep the scope limited, but I could handle that in this PR if we'd rather gain those benefits right away instead","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3448806676/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3927396597","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112041#issuecomment-3927396597","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112041","id":3927396597,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7qF1D1","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-19T13:42:51Z","updated_at":"2026-02-19T13:43:14Z","body":"Went ahead and un-suppressed the `[Variant] Utility functions` and `[ClassDB] Add exposed classes, builtin types, and global enums` tests. I restored them on a separate branch and compilation/testing worked without issue, so that might've been a false positive. Will keep an eye on, but I'll leave them untouched (assuming everything passes here too)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3927396597/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]